  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "At <math><mn>143</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the reaction of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> with <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> produces a xenon compound <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The total number of lone pair(s) of electrons present on the whole molecule of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> is __________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "19",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo> </mo><mo>→</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></p><p>Each <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> atom contains three lone pairs and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Xe</mi></math> atom contain one lone pair.</p><p>so total lone pair<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p><p>Total <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math>.<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/95061d8f-694a-468c-8190-cddda5e197aa-image.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
